us nominations and winning multiple awards. Today, it holds the record for the longest-running primetime medical drama ever.\\n\\nEvery Shonda Rhimes and Shondaland TV Show, Ranked\\n\\nShonda Rhimes ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/most-watched-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d89\"},\"ref\":\"d89\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dan Harmon on Being a Showrunner\\n\\nShonda Rhimes\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy premiered in 2005, launching the career of Shonda Rhimes, one of television's most successful and influential showrunners. For example, Rhimes has directed some of television's most popular shows, including Scandal, How to Get Away with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nfi.edu/showrunner/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d90\"},\"ref\":\"d90\",\"snippet\":\" ... act like real lawyers who might take on homicide cases? Why, or why not? What about them seems realistic or unrealistic to you?\\n\\nHave you watched any other shows by executive producer Shonda Rhimes? How are they like this show or unlike it? Does Rhimes' involvement make you ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.commonsensemedia.org/tv-reviews/how-to-get-away-with-murder\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d91\"},\"ref\":\"d91\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shonda Rhimes\\n\\nNet worth: $250 million\\n\\nRhimes brought in more than $2 billion to ABC's parent company, Disney, with hits such as the long-running medical drama Grey's Anatomy. She topped that with hit shows for Netflix including Bridgerton and its spin-off, Queen Charlotte: A ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/marisadellatto/2023/06/01/here-are-the-15-richest-women-celebrities-in-america/\"},{\