ho provides narration for a majority of the series' episodes.\\n\\nIn 2007, Rhimes created and produced the Grey's Anatomy spin-off series Private Practice, which debuted September 26, 2007, on ABC. The show chronicles the life of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shonda_Rhimes\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"ba0d2c122aee7aa15d979295271dc44209ffabb2d56572d35afdf86e4b370b4f\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"2d241b7ed28b78a56b983a0eb5bffa6168034741d1940394f19e377abcdccc76\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shonda Rhimes show actor real life relative cast together\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... the child was made to come on again, this time doing quite a different dance. It could have been obnoxious in another child. But Jackie Coogan was charming …\\\"\\n\\nChaplin decided to use the young performer in a movie, The Kid, in which his own tramp character discovers an ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.americanheritage.com/very-sad-story-jackie-coogan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d97\"},\"ref\":\"d97\",\"snippet\":\" ... This time Montgomery's lance struck the king's helmet sending three splinters into his head, including one which pierced his eye and brain.\\n\\nSomehow, Henry maintained consciousness enough to pardon Montgomery. He also survived the procedures to remove the splinters and it was hoped that the worst ... \",\"title\":\"https://thehistoricalnovel.com/2021/11/02/everything-wrong-with-reign-season-1/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_e