ef\":\"d104\"},\"ref\":\"d104\",\"snippet\":\" ... In this case, the banker's daughter rejected the proposal and never married; Hamerton married a Parisian woman the same year, but had only three children. Importantly, while men drew on this rhetoric of grudgingly accepted liabilities, fathers also privately expressed intense feelings of loneliness, grief and sometimes ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3865739/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"dd3692964e96c93ba9769762c5cd845b69d516b8341ea3ef152e92aeacd1f725\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0f9e8b2147ba2f8f87a76ce8e8aa721cff8d9342299668be3bf30c37943b2c5b\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Private Practice character married three times one child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_ce5de2a9f6b543bf9e2bfd83"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of Shameless (American TV series) characters - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2014-03-23\\n---\\nname: Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... He also appeared in the hit Showtime series Shameless as Sean, a recovering drug addict who runs a restaurant. In 2023, Mulroney starred in the sixth installment of the Scream franchise and starred in the Marvel Cinematic Universe television series Secret Invasion.\\n\\nPersonal life\\n\\nMulroney married actress Catherine ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d105\"},\"ref\":\"d105\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2019)\\nchildren: 2\\n\\nJeremy Allen White (born February 17, 1991) is an American actor. Raised in New York City, White began his career with minor roles, before his breakthrough role as Phillip \\\"Lip\\\" Gallagher in the comedy-drama series Shameless from 2011 to 2021, which earned him a ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeremy_Allen_White\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d106\"},\"ref\":\"d106\",\"snippet\":\" ... Red Line\\n\\n- Shameless\\n\\n- South Side\\n\\n2017\\n\\n- APB\\n\\n- Chicago Fire\\n\\n- Chicago Justice\\n\\n- Chicago Med\\n\\n- Chicago PD\\n\\n- Easy\\n\\n- Electric Dreams\\n\\n- Empire\\n\\n- Shameless\\n\\n- Suits\\n\\n- The Chi\\n\\n2016\\n\\n- Amazing Race\\n\\n- APB\\n\\n- Chicago Fire\\n\\n- Chicago Justice\\n\\n- Chicago Med\\n\\n- Chicago PD\\n\\n- Easy\\n\\n- Empire\\n\\n- The Exorcist\\n\\n- Married at First Sight\\n\\n- Patriot\\n\\n- Sense8\\n\\n- Shameless\\n\\n- Shrink\\n\\n- The ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.chicago.gov/city/en/depts/dca/supp_info/chicago_film_office7.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d107\"},\"ref\":\"d107\",\"snippet\":\" ... of Grace, Arrested Development, Search Party), Adam Scott (Parks and Recreation, Big Little Lies, Severance), Jeremy Allen White (Shameless, The Bear), Courtney Cox (Friends, Cougartown), Christina Applegate (Married…With Children, Dead to Me), Keri Russell (The Americans, The Diplomat), Alan Ruck (Spin City, Succession), Brian Cox (Deadwood, Succession ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.reddit.com/r/television/comments/167fh7z/actors_who_starred_in_multiple_hit_tv_shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d108\"},\"ref\":\"d108\",\"snippet\":\" ... Regardless, 2018 and before is the time span.\\n\\nWon emmys (multiple)\\n\\nWas written about in Nyt\\n\\nTherapist\\n\\nDifficulty conceiving\\n\\nSociopathic main character\\n\\nConfrontation between family members over the death of a child\\n\\nI think it suggests that \\\"John\\\" had been working on this show at the time his ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/questions/1586606-has-anyone-figured-out-what-john-s-tv\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d109\"},\"ref\":\"d109\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Movie, directed by series creator David Hollander, gave Schreiber's finest character to date the send-off that he deserved.\\n\\nThe Chi (2018-present)\\n\\nCreator Lena Waithe's mosaic of Chicago's South Side (a location shared with Shameless) is one of the network's most potent ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-showtime-series/?srsltid=AfmBOope-ZKI9-YErJA7mjiYv84GJSSCOaH6O146Ow7n5iWDl_98oBF2\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d110\"},\"ref\":\"d110\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2015, Rolling Stone ranked C.K.'s stand-up special Shameless number three on their \\\"Divine Comedy: 25 Best Stand-Up Specials and Movies of All Time\\\" list and ranked him fourth on its 2017 list of the 50 best stand-up comics of all time.\\n\\nC ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_C.K.\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d111\"},\"ref\":\"d111\",\"snippet\":\" ... He has been married to Joanna since 2012. They have two children. He was previously married to Julia, with whom he had two children.- Actor\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nSteven Ralph Schirripa is an American actor. He is best known for portraying Bobby Baccalieri on The Sopranos and Detective Anthony ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?name=Steve\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d112\"},\"ref\":\"d112\",\"snippet\":\" ... between multiple characters, there isnt any unnecessary drama that doesnt move our plot forward, the sneaking around… 😏\\n\\nemmy & ollie, the sweetest, funniest angels there are. every single interaction these two had with skylar through out the book put the biggest smile on my face. the first time ollie ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/209568782-wild-eyes\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"044e26da6c4d2d3f7ecd9658680591643d0186925f15718dd13d97d0a7cf7ae4\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"4a7046f38757c480916ea37d1b470a7f01c2e17baa28f9e6f22c8f19de7f435e\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless character married multiple times children\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d113\"},\"ref\":\"d113\",\"snippet\":\" ... From