rtainment/2017/07/60_years_of_hanna-barbera_cart.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... They look very similar, making it extremely believable.\\n\\n- French \\\"back from the dead\\\" show Les Revenants has twin sisters as two of its main characters, Lena and Camille. One dies, but comes back to life 4 years later, when her sister is played by an unrelated actress who ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d116\"},\"ref\":\"d116\",\"snippet\":\" ... The character was also featured as guest on the animated series House of Mouse, as well as its spin-off film Mickey's Magical Christmas: Snowed in at the House of Mouse.\\n\\nActors Scott Irby-Ranniar and Jason Raize played young and adult Simba, respectively, in the original ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simba\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d117\"},\"ref\":\"d117\",\"snippet\":\" ... Just as personal liabilities owed to a reporting individual by certain relatives need not be reported as assets, liabilities owed by a reporting individual to a spouse, parent, sibling, or child of the filer or of the filer's spouse need not be listed. Mortgages and home equity ... \",\"title\":\"https://ethics.house.gov/manual/specific-disclosure-requirements/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d118\"},\"ref\":\"d118\",\"snippet\":\" ... actors in completely unrelated roles in TV shows can go unnoticed by the audience, like Charles-Dean Chapman in Game of Thrones.\\n\\n- Talented actors, such as Tatiana Maslany in Orphan Black and Lisa Kudrow in Friends, can successfully portray multiple characters and create complex relationships on-screen.\\n\\nPlaying ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/actors-multiple-characters-same-tv-show/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d119\"},\"ref\":\"d119\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bell appeared in three episodes of The Tiny Chef Show and serves as the show's executive producer.\\n\\nBell also played the main character, an agnostic sex podcaster by the name of Joanne, in Nobody Wants This (2024). Her performance earned her another Golden Globe nomination for Best ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kristen_Bell\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d120\"},\"ref\":\"d120\",\"snippet\":\" ... loss of family/friends/way-of-life due to pandemic.\\n\\nOne-line synopsis: Station Eleven tells the story of a Hollywood star, his would-be savior, and a nomadic group of actors roaming the scattered outposts of the Great Lakes region, risking everything for art and humanity in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thefictionfox.com/post/ultimate-guide-to-grief-fiction\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2ddb74c4edb1428a136c4e407ee63a781e9675ffbb5bbb995dce4a91aaea35a6\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"bb4722c9f2c074d39c703c8ecdb078cb4e06aa2fd01418b8ac3479dcd2991df7\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor real life sibling spouse plays unrelated character same show\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Every woman who gets involved with Nate Romanowski - the series' resident badass - meets an untimely end.\\n\\n- The Cat Who... Series: Supporting character Iris Cobb was married three times, and all three of her husbands predeceased her — her first one (and the father of her only son) died of ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CartwrightCurse\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... Katie becomes pregnant just before Johnny dies and survives on her own until she agrees to marry Sergeant Michael McShane, a pipe-smoking local policeman-turned-politician.\\n\\nSissy Rommely is Katie's oldest sister and one of Francie's three aunts. Because of her parents' immigration and lack ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Tree_Grows_in_Brooklyn_(novel)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Aidy Bryant's Hulu series Shrill and in the 2019 film James vs. His Future Self. In 2023, he joined season 4 of Apple TV+'s critically acclaimed science fiction drama For All Mankind as the character Eli Hobson.\\n\\nHe and actress Laure Mattos have been married ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d121\"},\"ref\":\"d121\",\"snippet\":\" ... through the \\\"common hardship\\\" of being married to the \\\"abusive, psychologically imposing\\\" Rasheed. Mariam kills Rasheed while defending Laila, for which she is publicly executed by the Taliban.\\n*Laila, an ethnic Tajik born in Kabul in 1978. The only surviving child of Hakim and Fariba after her older ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Thousand_Splendid_Suns\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\" ... Erica's youngest child, Bianca Montgomery, enters the series in 1988. At that time, Bianca is Erica's first and only child since the Kendall and Josh characters were not created yet. In the storyline, Erica becomes pregnant with Travis Montgomery's child and develops toxemia. The story ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Kane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d122\"},\"ref\":\"d122\",\"snippet\":\" ... On December 13, 1944, tired of yet another failed romance, with a part-time actor named Harald Maresch, and pregnant with his child, Lupe committed suicide with an overdose of Seconal. She was only 36 years old.- Mildred Harris was born on 29 November 1901 in Cheyenne, Wyoming ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=1944&ref_=nm_pdt_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d97\"},\"ref\":\"d97\",\"snippet\":\" ... Mary's position was an interesting one and her relationship with England would be a complicated one for the entirety of her life. She inherited the throne of Scotland at only six days old, at which time Henry VIII was King of England. Henry wanted her to marry ... \",\"title\":\"https://thehistoricalnovel.com/2021/11/02/everything-wrong-with-reign-season-1/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d101\"},\"ref\":\"d101\",\"snippet\":\" ... Jarndyce takes in Ada and her child, a boy whom she names Richard. Esther and Mr Woodcourt marry and live in a Yorkshire house which Jarndyce gives to them. The couple later raise two daughters.\\n\\nMany of the novel's subplots focus on minor characters. One such subplot ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleak_House\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d123\"},\"ref\":\"d123\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nRomero was married three times. He married his first wife, Nancy, in 1971. They divorced in 1978. They had one child together, Cameron, who later became a filmmaker. \\n\\nRomero met his second wife, actress Christine Forrest, on the set of Season of the Witch (1972), and ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_A._Romero\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d124\"},\"ref\":\"d124\",\"snippet\":\" ... This kind wise narrator analyzes the social forces that connect or separate these characters, and enjoins us all to have sympathy for one another.\\n\\nIf you read only one thing this year, make it Middlemarch. Then take up some of these:\\n\\nScenes of Clerical Life, 1858. Four vignettes ... \",\"title\":\"https://readgreatliterature.com/literature-lists-timelines/english-victorian-literature-1830-1901-annotated-reading-list/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"975eababcdc6fe9901afe565ee7353370d560cdb50d04506147bfcf621f865f7\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6a9fbc82def18352f8940bf757121e6b5a9acb160d23008c18064d21bf59fe17\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character only one child survives series married four times\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_728ff61bc24545258c97997f"},{"content":"I notice the ScreenRant page (d15) mentions \"Jessica and Richard Harmon\" siblings who \"play unrelated characters\" — this is a strong lead for the \"real-life relative\" clue. Let me read that page and also search for the Harmon siblings' show.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d15\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_caca505376c945648b65a5d3","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jessica Harmon Richard Harmon siblings same TV show\", \"The 100 actors real life siblings unrelated characters\", \"Jessica Harmon actress height\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_9a7f7d2005fd4819ab563721","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d15\",\"document_chars\":9101,\"end\":3000,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"30d6d8bd1feaa16d7480eae3bbb0d0772ddf0a956d9870efc705af2df5ace29e\",\"snapshot\":\"a531c0a6be82cbe578781b28cb207ff02e87008856d5212ec2eab3fae2afe076\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Screen Rant\\nauthor: Joseph Allen\\ndate: 2018-04-13\\n---\\nThe CW's slate of programming is a fascinating one. Many of its shows are actually fairly well-regarded, whether they take place inside of the network's sprawling Arrowverse or not. Part of the reason these shows have been so successful is because of their excellent casting and captivating stars.\\n\\nAlthough the CW has a number of great shows on the air and a really great talent pool, they more than occasionally like to cast actors who are actually related to one another in real life, or are married and have decided to form a new family with one another.\\n\\nWhether these two relatives show up on the same show or not depends on the specifics of the situation, but as many of the couples on this list are married, it's often the case that the two of them met while they were filming together. Other times, the relationship between the two actors was the reason that one of them was brought onto a show.\\n\\nWhatever the reasons might be, it's clear that the CW has no fears about keeping things close. After all, if one actor from a family works out, who's to say that others won't, too?\\n\\nHere are 15 CW Stars That Only True Fans Know Are Actually Family.\\n\\nStephen And Robbie Amell\\n\\nThis one is among the most readily apparent on this list, in part because Robbie and Stephen Amell share a last name. The cousins have also made homes for themselves on the CW, where they have both played superheroes.\\n\\nStephen has been Oliver Queen on Arrow for several years, and Robbie has played Firestorm on The Flash. Robbie also played a teleporting hero on Tomorrow People, which has been off the air for a few years now.\\n\\nIn addition to sharing an employer, at least sometimes, the two cousins also look quite a bit alike, and are each quite handsome. Of course, there a number of families who have spawned multiple successful actors because, at the end of the day, part of the reason actors are famous is because of their looks, which the Amells have in spades.\\n\\nJared Padalecki And Genevieve Cortese\\n\\nJared Padalecki has had a pretty long and steady career on television, and he's even had the chance to work with his future wife.\\n\\nPadalecki and Genevieve Cortese actually met on the set of Supernatural when Cortese was a recurring guest during the show's fourth season. Cortese played Ruby, a demon who seduces Padalecki's character and causes a rift to form between Sam and Dean.\\n\\nAlthough the affair between Sam and Ruby proved to be short-lived, Padalecki and Cortese's relationship turned out to be a pretty stable one. The couple eventually got married, and they now live in Austin, Texas with their three children. Supernatural is a show with plenty of tragedy, but things seemed to have ended in a happily ever after for Padalecki and Cortese.\\n\\nAly And AJ Michalka\\n\\nAly and AJ Michalka have been famous since a fairly young age. Both actresses made their debuts on the Disney Channel when they were still quite young, and they also to\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":3000,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_caca505376c945648b65a5d3"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... the same CW show, but both were on the network at roughly the same time.\\n\\nOf course, that was long before they were married in 2014, so maybe the CW was one of the first things they talked about.\\n\\nJessica And Richard Harmon\\n\\nActors who are siblings in ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d125\"},\"ref\":\"d125\",\"snippet\":\" ... known to TV audiences as Eric Forman's ornery dad Red on That '70s Show. He provides that same ornery spirit to the role of General Nathan on Rick and Morty in \\\"Get Schwifty.\\\"\\n\\nJim Rash\\n\\nGlaxo Slimslom\\n\\nJim Rash is another frequent Dan Harmon collaborator, best known ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/rick-and-morty-voice-actors-guide/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d126\"},\"ref\":\"d126\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2024-07-08\\n---\\nIt runs in the family\\n\\nHollywood is home to many talented siblings who have taken the entertainment industry by storm. From acting dynasties to musical prodigies, these siblings sha